  "description": "Years of production: 2005-2012\n\nSucceeded, after a break, by the limited edition SodaMAX in 2018.\n\nThe Soda was our original titanium hardtail: a 26\" trail bike made from titanium rather than our usual steel, light, lively and built to last. It was taken everywhere, from local singletrack to the World XC Championships in 2009.\n\nWe didn’t keep a full archive record of the original Soda, so this page is shorter than most. If you own one and have photos or details to share, we’d love to hear from you at info@cotic.co.uk.",
